updated_at":"2026-11-21T08:55:24Z"},{"id":774990334,"node_id":"RA_kwDORwA07s4uMWn-","name":"stable-win-x64-update.json","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/json","state":"uploaded","size":199,"digest":"sha256:52069bdc20e4fd36f6c9420e594941bf56fb926391b27db74c07b1d352c8349e","download_count":111,"created_at":"2026-11-21T08:55:24Z","updated_at":"2026-11-21T08:55:24Z"},{"id":774990350,"node_id":"RA_kwDORwA07s4uMWoO","name":"stable-win-x64-update.json.sha256","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":93,"digest":"sha256:9d8f745ac03968a374d296a82cdee1a59813def8560dd7da4613e39b1562100f","download_count":2,"created_at":"2026-11-21T08:55:24Z","updated_at":"2026-11-21T08:55:24Z"}],"body":"## Highlights\n\n- **Your first watchlist keeps its names.** A watchlist you filled before Gloom's first launch is no longer replaced by the starter tickers; they get a list of their own. (#2879)\n- **Rebind navigation and layout keys.** Directions, nested views and saved-layout shortcuts can be changed in Help or in config, for Bépo and other keyboard layouts. (#2858)\n- **A colour for each chart indicator.** Each study and series on `G`, `GP`, `GIP` and `CMP` can take its own colour, kept in saved layouts and share links. (#2878)\n- **Panes come back with their data.** After an abrupt exit, panes reopen on their last data with its age shown, and refresh behind it. (#2822)\n\n## Also in this release\n\n- Price and move alerts judge every live tick and never fire on an old saved price, and live market data uses less CPU in the terminal. (#2885, #2871)\n- A listing on its first trading day charts its intraday bars on every range. (#2849)\n- `SEG` shows Hong Kong companies' reported periods, labelled by fiscal year. (#2826, #2830)\n- Coin overviews show supply and market-cap rank, and pressing Upgrade signed out shows what Pro is. (#2865, #2881)\n- Prague listings take `.PR` and Pakistan listings `.KA`. (#2884)\n\n[Full diff](https://github.com/gloom-sh/gloomberb/compare/v0.20.19...v0.20.20)\n"}
